{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_79_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_79","text":"大寶積經無量夀會校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_79_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_79","text":"一．本書校歷二週．一譯校．二刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_79_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_79","text":"二．譯校凡用三種異本對勘。（一）梵文大本極樂莊嚴經．校註略稱梵本。（二）曹魏","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_79_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_79","text":"康僧鎧譯佛說無量夀經．略稱魏本。（三）宋法賢譯佛說大乘無量夀莊嚴經．略","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_79_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_79","text":"稱宋本。別有漢支婁迦讖譯無量清淨平等覺經．吳支謙譯佛說阿彌陀經．均爲","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_79_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_79","text":"是書異譯．大體同於魏本而文次凌亂過之．今不具勘。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_79_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_79","text":"三．譯校凡有二例。（一）章段．用魏宋二本對勘．次第具缺有互異處皆註出曰．某本","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_79_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_79","text":"雲雲。（二）文義．概用魏本對勘．註出異文曰．魏本雲雲。其四十八願一段．參用梵","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_79_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_79","text":"本對勘．註出異義曰．梵本雲雲。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_79_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_79","text":"四．刻校用南宋刻爲底本．對勘麗刻改正文字．附註曰．原刻雲雲．依麗刻雲雲。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_79_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_79","text":"五．對勘資料出處如次。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_79_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_79","text":"（一）梵文大本極樂莊嚴經．Sukha^vati^vyuha(pp．11-21)．F．MaxMuller及南條文雄(B．Nanjio)校刊本．一八八三年．英國牛津版。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_79_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_79","text":"（二）魏譯無量夀經．","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_79_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_79","text":"（三）宋譯大乘無量夀莊嚴經．以上二種均用日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_79_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_79","text":"大正大藏經本。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_79_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_79","text":"（四）本書南宋刻及麗刻．悉依日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及大正大藏經本","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_79_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_79","text":"之校註。","sortOrder":17}],"overrides":{}}